# Audit

On **audit**, **full scan**, **check everything**, or repeat **still broken** / **anything else**:

1. **Loop back** if repeat ask — `loop-back-protocol.mdc`.
2. **`run_audit.cmd`** — full tests; never `-SkipTests` (step 1).
3. Read **`docs/.audit_agent_manifest.json`** — **`machineFixesBySection`**: listed letters cannot be "Nothing found." in semantic report; use **`agentFocus`** for the rest.
4. Edit **`docs/.audit_semantic_report.json`** — non-clean summaries **must cite files** and include **`evidence[]`**; run **`scripts\verify_semantic_audit.cmd`** (step 2).
5. **`scripts\finalize_audit.cmd`** — step 3 (machine + semantic verify + harness; skips tests when manifest proof valid).
6. Report **only** Fix and Improve. Every gap → Fix (remove) or Improve (mitigate).

Do not claim audit complete unless **`finalize_audit.cmd`** (or full **`run_audit.cmd`** with semantic already complete) exits 0.
